#org @gText_PCBoxSortMenuName
Sort Boxes

#org @gText_PCBoxSortMenuDescription
Sort the Pok\emon in your boxes,\nleaving no gaps between Pok\emon.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortSpeciesAZ
Species A-Z

#org @gText_PCBoxSortSpeciesAZDescription
Sorts every Box by species name,\nfrom A to Z.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortSpeciesZA
Species Z-A

#org @gText_PCBoxSortSpeciesZADescription
Sorts every Box by species name,\nfrom Z to A.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortDexLowHigh
Pok\edex Low-High

#org @gText_PCBoxSortDexLowHighDescription
Sorts every Box by Pok\edex number,\nlowest first.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortDexHighLow
Pok\edex High-Low

#org @gText_PCBoxSortDexHighLowDescription
Sorts every Box by Pok\edex number,\nhighest first.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortLevelLowHigh
Level Low-High

#org @gText_PCBoxSortLevelLowHighDescription
Sorts every Box by level, lowest\nfirst.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortLevelHighLow
Level High-Low

#org @gText_PCBoxSortLevelHighLowDescription
Sorts every Box by level, highest\nfirst.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortNevermindDescription
Return to all Box options.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortConfirm
Every Pok\emon will be moved and\nall gaps closed up. Is that okay?

#org @gText_PCBoxSortWorking
Sorting your Boxes[.]

#org @gText_PCBoxSortDone
Your Boxes have been sorted!

#org @gText_PCBoxSortNothingToDo
There are no Pok\emon in the Boxes.

#org @gText_PCBoxSortFailed
The Boxes couldn't be sorted.
